# The required keys of the product. env/AGENTS.md has the rules of this file.
#
# Each key below has no default. Copy each line into the .env of the host,
# remove the # at its start and give it the value of the host. A copy of
# this file as it is sets nothing, and a program that reads it stops with a
# line for each required key. Each value below is an example only.
#
# The owner of the repositories that a release reads.
#AGENT_GITHUB_OWNER=example-owner
# The account of the operator, which runs the user units.
#AGENT_OPERATOR_USER=operator
# The LAN address of the host.
#AGENT_LAN_ADDRESS=192.0.2.10
